        "subject": "LU-17077 tests: wait for quota release in sanity-quota/75",
        "message": "LU-17077 tests: wait for quota release in sanity-quota/75\n\nThe squashed-root DoM part of test 75 removes files written\nto one target and then expects a write within the limit to\nsucceed on another, as test 63 does. Grant still held for\nthe removed files can exhaust the limit first.\n\nBefore each of its three phases, including the first, which\nfollows the hard-limit check on the OST, wait for deferred\ndestroys and for enough grant to be released.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=75,ONLY_REPEAT=20\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=75,ONLY_REPEAT=20\nFixes: bbfdc7c1670c (\"LU-14739 quota: fix quota with root squash enabled\")\nAssisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.1-sol\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrickbot <patrick-bot@mulberrytree.us>\nChange-Id: I32f486c38469641b36c1950f64d4f3f7df706902\n"
